<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Storybook Panels</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #222;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .container {
            width: 540px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }
        .panel {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .image-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #d8cbbd;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 14px;
            z-index: 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #666;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        /* Proportional heights based on the original image */
        .panel-1 { height: 315px; }
        .panel-2 { height: 105px; }
        .panel-3 { height: 115px; }
        .panel-4 { height: 95px; }
        .panel-5 { height: 92px; }

        .panel-1 .image-placeholder { background-color: #e2d1c3; }
        .panel-2 .image-placeholder { background-color: #b1a196; }
        .panel-3 .image-placeholder { background-color: #c7b39f; }
        .panel-4 .image-placeholder { background-color: #d4bda9; }
        .panel-5 .image-placeholder { background-color: #b9afa6; border-bottom: none; }

        .overlay-text {
            position: absolute;
            background-color: rgba(25, 25, 25, 0.75);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            z-index: 1;
            white-space: nowrap;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .text-1 {
            bottom: 25px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .text-2 {
            top: 25px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .text-3 {
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        .text-4 {
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 14.5px;
        }
        .text-5 {
            bottom: 15px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            font-size: 13.5px;
        }

        /* UI Callout styles */
        .callout-container {
            position: absolute;
            top: 125px;
            left: 195px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .callout-line-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .callout-dot {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .callout-line {
            width: 22px;
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .callout-box {
            background-color: rgba(140, 135, 130, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            position: relative;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
        }
        .handle {
            position: absolute;
            width: 5px;
            height: 5px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .h-tl { top: -3px; left: -3px; }
        .h-tc { top: -3px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
        .h-tr { top: -3px; right: -3px; }
        .h-ml { top: 50%; left: -3px; transform: translateY(-50%); }
        .h-mr { top: 50%; right: -3px; transform: translateY(-50%); }
        .h-bl { bottom: -3px; left: -3px; }
        .h-bc { bottom: -3px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); }
        .h-br { bottom: -3px; right: -3px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="panel panel-1">
        <div class="image-placeholder">[Illustration: Mr. McBee]</div>

        <div class="callout-container">
            <div class="callout-line-group">
                <div class="callout-dot"></div>
                <div class="callout-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="callout-box">
                故事都非常好
                <div class="handle h-tl"></div>
                <div class="handle h-tc"></div>
                <div class="handle h-tr"></div>
                <div class="handle h-ml"></div>
                <div class="handle h-mr"></div>
                <div class="handle h-bl"></div>
                <div class="handle h-bc"></div>
                <div class="handle h-br"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="overlay-text text-1">"Well, no," said Mr. McBee. "Not really."</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-2">
        <div class="image-placeholder">[Photo: Reading "Library Lion"]</div>
        <div class="overlay-text text-2">"But there's a lion!" said Mr. McBee. "In the library!"</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-3">
        <div class="image-placeholder">[Illustration: Lion sniffing card catalog]</div>
        <div class="overlay-text text-3">He sniffed the card catalog.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-4">
        <div class="image-placeholder">[Illustration: Lion lying down]</div>
        <div class="overlay-text text-4">There weren't any rules about lions at story hour, either.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-5">
        <div class="image-placeholder">[Photo: Reading "Library Lion"]</div>
        <div class="overlay-text text-5">He waited for another story, but the children began to walk away.</div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>```
